    ],
    "rulings": [
      {
        "answer": "No. Having this card become a Digimon as a result of ＜De-Digivolve  nocategory＞ (Trash up to nocategory cards from the top. You can't trash past level 3 cards.) doesn’t count as playing it, so you can’t draw any cards.",
        "question": "A Digimon with this card in its digivolution cards is targeted with ＜De-Digivolve  nocategory＞ (Trash up to nocategory cards from the top. You can't trash past level 3 cards.) by my opponent, resulting in this card now being the Digimon’s top card. Do I draw 2 cards with this card's [On Play] effect?",
        "reference": "[1]"
      }
    ]
  },
